Simorgh — notice file
====================

This repository publishes server-discovery data for the Simorgh macOS app.

It is a rebranded, independently maintained port of the server-discovery
mechanism of zeghostwriter/ZeroNet (https://github.com/zeghostwriter/ZeroNet),
which is distributed under the MIT License:

