The CI workflows in .github/workflows/, the publish script in
.github/scripts/, and the feed layouts in deploy/crowd/ are derived from that
project's proven mechanism (harvest → test → sign → publish to a `crowd-data`
branch), adapted to Simorgh branding, repository names, and tool names.

